  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a claypot over medium heat. Add onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add carrots and potatoes and cook for 5 minutes, until slightly tender.",
    "Add zucchini and cook for 3 minutes, until slightly tender.",
    "Stir in tomato paste and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Pour in broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Stir in ginger, lemon juice, and kale. ",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley if desired."
